        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror experience set in a secluded house deep within the forest.<br>Uncover the truth of your past through quiet exploration and unease.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration adventure.<br>Interact with objects and collect fragments of memory as you unravel the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 15–30 minutes to complete.<br>Perfect for a short, immersive horror experience—even for newcomers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Horror / Exploration Adventure</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Unique Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely <strong>monochrome world</strong> enhances the eerie silence and surreal atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares. Fear comes from the <strong>slow, creeping dread</strong> that builds as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on <strong>psychological horror</strong>, using sound and space to instill a deep sense of discomfort.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Behind the Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a 19-year-old student.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely self-taught in both programming and design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed in just two months with <strong>zero budget</strong>—a true passion project and debut title.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Stream</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OK!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror experience set in a secluded house deep within the forest.<br>Uncover the truth of your past through quiet exploration and unease.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration adventure.<br>Interact with objects and collect fragments of memory as you unravel the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 15–30 minutes to complete.<br>Perfect for a short, immersive horror experience—even for newcomers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Horror / Exploration Adventure</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Unique Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely <strong>monochrome world</strong> enhances the eerie silence and surreal atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cheap jump scares. Fear comes from the <strong>slow, creeping dread</strong> that builds as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on <strong>psychological horror</strong>, using sound and space to instill a deep sense of discomfort.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Behind the Scenes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a 19-year-old student.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely self-taught in both programming and design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed in just two months with <strong>zero budget</strong>—a true passion project and debut title.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Stream</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OK!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A first-person Japanese horror set in a secluded forest house. With no loud jump scares, it’s ideal for beginners. Playtime: 15–30 minutes. Monochrome visuals create quiet, creeping tension. Developed in two months by a 19-year-old student, focusing on slow, unsettling exploration.",
